{
  "file" : "npc/cities/ayothaya.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "text" : "Hoo! Hah! Hoo! Hah!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "text" : "Let me take you away to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "text" : "a distant spiritual place,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "text" : "a land of exotic mystery,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "text" : "my hometown Ayothaya!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "text" : "About Ayothaya."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "text" : "Go to Ayothaya."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "text" : "Cancel."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "text" : "We Ayothayans are a pious people who value peace and sincerity. We endeavor to lead simple, yet noble, lives in harmony with nature."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "text" : "Our traditional cuisine is world famous. It's no surprise when we serve dishes like Tom Yum Goong, made of Shrimp, Lemon and Chillies, which has a tantalizing aroma and flavor beyond imagining."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "text" : "For those who crave adventure, there is an age old story about the Sa-mhing Tiger, an evil creature that haunts our temple ruins."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "text" : "Hoo! Hahh! Hoo! Hahh!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "text" : "No man alive can resist the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "text" : "call of this beautiful land."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "text" : "Midgardians are"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "text" : "always welcome!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "text" : "Ah, you must pay 10,000 Zeny"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "text" : "if you wish to visit Ayothaya."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "text" : "If you're ready, we can leave"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "text" : "right now~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "text" : "I'm ready, let's go!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "text" : "No."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "text" : "Hoo! Hah! Hoo! Hah!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "text" : "Let us be off! Back to my"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "text" : "beautiful Ayothaya!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "text" : "I am sorry, but you do not have the 10,000 Zeny to travel to Ayothaya. Such a price is nothing compared to the experiences that await you!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "text" : "Have you ever dreamed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "text" : "of a beautiful place filled"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "text" : "with spiritual serenity? You"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "text" : "must have been dreaming"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "text" : "of Ayothaya, my friend."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "text" : "Hoo! Hah! Hmm! Hah!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "text" : "So, how did you like Ayothaya? Did you get a chance to try Tom Yum Goong? When you're ready, I shall take you back home."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "text" : "Go back to Alberta."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "text" : "Cancel."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "text" : "You will be welcome to come back whenever you please. I hope that we will see each other again sometime soon. Thank you~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "text" : "Ah yes. I understand that it is difficult to take leave of such a beautiful place. Do not worry"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "text" : "and take your time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "[Thang]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "There's an ancient,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "dreadful building in"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "Ayothaya that no one"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "here dares approach..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "[Thang]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "In the past, a few curious people went inside, despite the horror stories, and never returned. What on earth could be going on inside of that place?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "[Thang]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "However, if you want to prove your courage to others, confronting the danger inside might be a worthy challenge for an adventurer..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "I think."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Hello!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "I don't think"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "we've met before."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "You must be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "from Midgard."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "After all, I know every single person living in this village."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Heh heh~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "May I ask about the land you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "come from? I'm curious about"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "a lot of things in the outside world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "You know, like the dresses and jewelry that ladies wear in other countries, whether or not the men are good looking, what kind of songs you have, what kind of girls that guys over there like..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
