      "text" : "........."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : ".........."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Okay~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Take care and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "enjoy your travels!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "When you go East from this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "village, you will arrive at the ruins of an old shrine. It is now"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "a nest full of fearsome monsters."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "If you plan to venture through these ruins, you better prepare"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "as much as you can!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Ah..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "I wonder where"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "my Black Knight is~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Don't you mean..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Knight in shining armor"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "riding a white horse?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Hmm...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Oh, well..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "I'll take them both!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Hee hee~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Mmm...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "What's up?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "[Villager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Ummm."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Hmmmmm..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Ummmmm...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "[Villager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "You must be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "an outsider."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Yes. Yes, indeed."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "[Villager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Did you just ask"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "where am I going?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Why, to the Fishing Spot"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "just ahead. That's what"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "we old men do: fish."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "[Villager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 209,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Hmmm..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Would you like to hear"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "something interesting? I've heard that someone found a ring inside"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "a fish he caught in the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Fishing Spot."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 215,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "[Villager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 216,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Supposedly, there are lots of stories about people finding valuables inside of the fish they've been catching there."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "[Villager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "If you're lucky enough,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "you might even become"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "a millionaire."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Heh heh heh~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "[Villager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 225,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "...!?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Ah, I came into the fish market! ^666666*Sigh*^000000 It seems I went the wrong way. The Fishing Spot is on the opposite side of this village."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "[Villager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "Since I'm here, it wouldn't be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "a bad idea to look around. All of the seafood in this market is fresh and tasty. You'll regret it if you don't try some of this seafood"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Old Man",
      "text" : "at least once."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 236,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "[Kwan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 237,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "Phew, isn't it"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "soooo hot today?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "[Kwan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 241,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "You must be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 242,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "from Midgard, huh?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "I've seen a lot of tourists"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "coming from there recently."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "[Kwan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "You'd better be really careful if you travel outside of the village. Whatever you do, don't go into"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "the ruins of an old shrine"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "in the forest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "[Kwan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 252,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "That place is far too"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 253,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "text" : "dangerous to visit. Still, I hear that if you had some kind of amulet, you could go there with"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
